{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "d75ae21741a94d91",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "事件",
   "x": 1242,
   "y": 70,
   "width": 1088,
   "height": 568
  },
  {
   "id": "891803f5f7adc05c",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "南極埋伏：誰的安排？",
   "x": 2412,
   "y": 46,
   "width": 836,
   "height": 1004
  },
  {
   "id": "15b656be28fbb5d6",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "阿拉拉的立場？",
   "x": 8,
   "y": 46,
   "width": 1226,
   "height": 1392
  },
  {
   "id": "5d17d71f7d706c02",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**明星推歌**\n\n成為明星推出人魚公主平常唱的歌吸引人魚公主注意，引導她們懷疑長老",
   "x": 1266,
   "y": 466,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "1120d807603af17c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**揭海因茨身份**\n\n告訴米迦勒海因茨是舒華澤的人，且知道舒華澤的人法力沒有共振特性",
   "x": 1656,
   "y": 466,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "a1b0b1f6b72cba1e",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**警告海因茨**\n\n警告海因茨人魚公主比米迦勒更危險",
   "x": 2046,
   "y": 478,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "50031a31825703fc",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "在神殿出口埋伏",
   "x": 2046,
   "y": 102,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "a49ca66e5d6b1bc3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**米迦勒預料出口**\n\n米迦勒料到人魚公主會到神殿調查並從海底的隱藏出口離開",
   "x": 2964,
   "y": 478,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "193d944d39b3627a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**故意引導捉人**\n\n米迦勒故意引導人魚公主調查，好趁人魚公主落單時捉走",
   "x": 2964,
   "y": 902,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "69729dc0dc383d46",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**米迦勒不知神殿存在**\n\n米迦勒不知道神殿的存在",
   "x": 2769,
   "y": 78,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "d7c5b6ec15df4538",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**自行埋伏**\n\n自行前往埋伏，引導人魚公主懷疑己方存在叛徒",
   "x": 2574,
   "y": 478,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "97738d7e358fe29a",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**不受米迦勒指揮**\n\n知道神殿構造、不受米迦勒指揮",
   "x": 2505,
   "y": 914,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "8e4c7cd77cf19474",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "背後有完整團隊",
   "x": 32,
   "y": 938,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "21a7c05f00ef7236",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "態度不像米迦勒手下",
   "x": 950,
   "y": 938,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "80ca8c497655eba2",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "真正的幕後黑手",
   "x": 950,
   "y": 1338,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "8c21fdede7064ded",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**知人魚秘密**\n\n可能知道人魚公主的秘密",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 1314,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "1becfa18361fc861",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**視人魚危險異常**\n\n認為人魚公主危險是不尋常的想法",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 902,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "b31a54394c2ffdca",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**加深監視懷疑**\n\n使監視者對海因茨懷疑加深",
   "x": 491,
   "y": 78,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  }
 ],
